NNAAMMEE
     zzffss--pprrooggrraamm — execute ZFS channel programs

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     zzffss pprrooggrraamm [--jjnn] [--tt _i_n_s_t_r_u_c_t_i_o_n_-_l_i_m_i_t] [--mm _m_e_m_o_r_y_-_l_i_m_i_t] _p_o_o_l _s_c_r_i_p_t
